  "prefLabel": "Csp 203.01 Adopted Adjudicative Proceedings Rules",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Csp 203.01 Adopted Adjudicative Proceedings Rules. Pursuant to RSA 541-A:30-a, IV, the commission has adopted the text of the model rules for adjudicative proceedings as established by the attorney general in rule Jus 800 which shall be in effect at the time of such adjudicative proceedings.\n\nSource. #9584, eff 11-2-09",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/csp100-700.html"
